pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: top-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: dir-badge-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 30, 100, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: dir-badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 30, 100, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$white"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Accelerator / DPU...</p>
  - elementId: bg-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 70, 400, 36]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>研究背景</p>
  - elementId: bg-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 110, 1160, 220]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      wrap: true
      text: |
        <p>• CPU TEE 不能天然保护 accelerator offload path，敏感数据进入 GPU、driver、PCIe fabric 或 remote resource...</p>
  - elementId: divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 340, 1160, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$border"
  - elementId: sol-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 360, 400, 36]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>解决方案</p>
  - elementId: sol-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 400, 1160, 260]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      wrap: true
      text: |
        <p>• Security Controller 作为 thin TCB 管理 accelerator assignment、加密认证、remote attestation、secure...</p>
        <p>• Rack-level Security Controller</p>
        <p>• PCIe ExpressFabric accelerator assignment</p>
        <p>• Remote attestation and secure cleanup lifecycle</p>
  - elementId: bottom-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
